; THE WARREN opening proof (S1 seam 4, v2): the bot drops at the
; warren player spawn and fights the dungeon's opening — the
; entrance pack alone, because v2's distance discipline keeps every
; other room's pack >12 t away (iteration 1's multi-room killbox is
; the recorded lesson: aggro crosses walls). Deeper rooms are the
; player's crawl; the king's fight is proof_king_grubb's job.
; Mirrors the_warren.tres spawns exactly (the green test pins both).

